14.220"><span begin="00:08.190" end="00:08.460">All </span><span begin="00:08.460" end="00:08.700">I </span><span begin="00:08.700" end="00:08.940">know </span><span begin="00:08.940" end="00:09.270">is </span><span begin="00:09.270" end="00:09.690">10</span><span begin="00:09.690" end="00:09.720">:</span><span begin="00:09.720" end="00:10.860">35 </span><span begin="00:10.860" end="00:10.950">and </span><span begin="00:10.950" end="00:10.980">I</span><span begin="00:10.980" end="00:11.100">’</span><span begin="00:11.100" end="00:11.220">m </span><span begin="00:11.220" end="00:11.670">thanking</span><span begin="00:11.670" end="00:11.670">, </span><span begin="00:11.670" end="00:12.180">thanking </span><span begin="00:12.180" end="00:12.750">God </span><span begin="00:12.750" end="00:12.900">you </span><span begin="00:12.900" end="00:13.470">found </span><span begin="00:13.470" end="00:14.220">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.610" end="00:17.610"><span begin="00:14.610" end="00:14.970">That </span><span begin="00:14.970" end="00:15.060">you </span><span begin="00:15.060" end="00:15.570">found </span><span begin="00:15.570" end="00:17.610">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.670" end="00:20.670"><span begin="00:17.670" end="00:18.720">Everyday</span><span begin="00:18.720" end="00:18.720">, </span><span begin="00:18.720" end="00:19.020">I </span><span begin="00:19.020" end="00:19.170">go </span><span begin="00:19.170" end="00:19.770">places </span><span begin="00:19.770" end="00:19.830">in </span><span begin="00:19.830" end="00:20.040">my </span><span begin="00:20.040" end="00:20.670">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.700" end="00:22.440"><span begin="00:20.700" end="00:21.060">Dark </span><span begin="00:21.060" end="00:21.180">and </span><span begin="00:21.180" end="00:21.720">tussle</span><span begin="00:21.720" end="00:21.720">, </span><span begin="00:21.720" end="00:21.960">hard </span><span begin="00:21.960" end="00:22.020">to </span><span begin="00:22.020" end="00:22.440">know</span><span begin="00:22.440" end="00:22.440">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.440" end="00:25.350"><span begin="00:22.440" end="00:22.710">They </span><span begin="00:22.710" end="00:23.010">look </span><span begin="00:23.010" end="00:23.220">like </span><span begin="00:23.220" end="00:23.790">monsters </span><span begin="00:23.790" end="00:24.000">under </span><span begin="00:24.000" end="00:24.240">my </span><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:25.350">bed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.590" end="00:28.620"><span begin="00:25.590" end="00:25.830">And </span><span begin="00:25.830" end="00:26.100">every </span><span begin="00:26.100" end="00:26.580">time</span><span begin="00:26.580" end="00:26.580">, </span><span begin="00:26.580" end="00:26.730">it's </span><span begin="00:26.730" end="00:26.970">like </span><span begin="00:26.970" end="00:27.090">a </span><span begin="00:27.090" end="00:27.600">rocket </span><span begin="00:27.600" end="00:27.780">through </span><span begin="00:27.780" end="00:28.080">my </span><span begin="00:28.080" end="00:28.620">chest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.620" end="00:32.400"><span begin="00:28.620" end="00:28.740">But </span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.010">did </span><span begin="00:29.010" end="00:29.130">even </span><span begin="00:29.130" end="00:29.430">make </span><span begin="00:29.430" end="00:29.550">you </span><span begin="00:29.550" end="00:29.880">think </span><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:30.000">the </span><span begin="00:30.000" end="00:30.210">whole </span><span begin="00:30.210" end="00:30.690">world's </span><span begin="00:30.690" end="00:31.020">about </span><span begin="00:31.020" end="00:31.170">to </span><span begin="00:31.170" end="00:32.400">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.430" end="00:36.150"><span begin="00:32.430" end="00:32.790">I </span><span begin="00:32.790" end="00:32.970">don</span><span begin="00:32.970" end="00:33.000">’</span><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.060">t </span><span begin="00:33.060" end="00:33.240">know </span><span begin="00:33.240" end="00:33.510">where </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:33.750">this </span><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.050">die </span><span begin="00:34.050" end="00:34.230">the </span><span begin="00:34.230" end="00:36.150">going</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.330" end="00:40.170"><span begin="00:36.330" end="00:36.510">But </span><span begin="00:36.510" end="00:36.660">I </span><span begin="00:36.660" end="00:36.960">know </span><span begin="00:36.960" end="00:37.260">that </span><span begin="00:37.260" end="00:37.620">you </span><span begin="00:37.620" end="00:38.160">need </span><span begin="00:38.160" end="00:40.170">someday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.350" end="00:43.320"><span begin="00:40.350" end="00:40.650">So </span><span begin="00:40.650" end="00:41.190">many </span><span begin="00:41.190" end="00:41.580">things </span><span begin="00:41.580" end="00:41.820">that </span><span begin="00:41.820" end="00:42.060">I'm </span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.810">afraid </span><span begin="00:42.810" end="00:43.320">of</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.400" end="00:47.820"><span begin="00:44.400" end="00:44.730">But </span><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:45.000">right </span><span begin="00:45.000" end="00:45.270">now </span><span begin="00:45.270" end="00:45.510">I </span><span begin="00:45.510" end="00:45.600">ain't </span><span begin="00:45.600" end="00:46.110">scared </span><span begin="00:46.110" end="00:46.170">of </span><span begin="00:46.170" end="00:47.820">nothing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.820" end="00:49.200"><span begin="00:47.820" end="00:48.000">（</span><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:48.240">'Cause </span><span begin="00:48.240" end="00:48.420">all </span><span begin="00:48.420" end="00:48.690">I </span><span begin="00:48.690" end="00:49.050">know </span><span begin="00:49.050" end="00:49.200">is</span><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.200">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.200" end="00:52.320"><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.200">（</span><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:50.220">All </span><span begin="00:50.220" end="00:50.700">I </span><span begin="00:50.700" end="00:50.940">know </span><span begin="00:50.940" end="00:51.030">is</span><span begin="00:51.030" end="00:51.030">, </span><span begin="00:51.030" end="00:51.270">all </span><span begin="00:51.270" end="00:51.300">I</span><span begin="00:51.300" end="00:51.870">—</span><span begin="00:51.870" end="00:51.870">, </span><span begin="00:51.870" end="00:51.960">all </span><span begin="00:51.960" end="00:52.050">I</span><span begin="00:52.050" end="00:52.320">—</span><span begin="00:52.320" end="00:52.320">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.320" end="00:57.810"><span begin="00:52.320" end="00:52.440">All </span><span begin="00:52.440" end="00:52.680">I </span><span begin="00:52.680" end="00:52.920">know </span><span begin="00:52.920" end="00:53.220">is </span><span begin="00:53.220" end="00:53.730">10</span><span begin="00:53.730" end="00:53.730">:</span><span begin="00:53.730" end="00:55.140">35 </span><span begin="00:55.140" end="00:55.290">and </span><span begin="00:55.290" end="00:55.380">I </span><span begin="00:55.380" end="00:55.650">can </span><span begin="00:55.650" end="00:55.980">feel </span><span begin="00:55.980" end="00:56.250">your </span><span begin="00:56.250" end="00:56.820">arms </span><span begin="00:56.820" end="00:57.450">around </span><span begin="00:57.450" end="00:57.810">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.740" end="00:59.940"><span begin="00:58.740" end="00:58.980">Let </span><span begin="00:58.980" end="00:59.100">'em </span><span begin="00:59.100" end="00:59.490">drown </span><span begin="00:59.490" end="00:59.940">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.240" end="01:06.180"><span begin="01:00.240" end="01:00.480">All </span><span begin="01:00.480" end="01:00.690">I </span><span begin="01:00.690" end="01:00.960">know </span><span begin="01:00.960" end="01:01.260">is </span><span begin="01:01.260" end="01:01.740">10</span><span begin="01:01.740" end="01:01.740">:</span><span begin="01:01.740" end="01:02.700">35 </span><span begin="01:02.700" end="01:02.940">and </span><span begin="01:02.940" end="01:03.210">I'm </span><span begin="01:03.210" end="01:03.750">thanking</span><span begin="01:03.750" end="01:03.750">, </span><span begin="01:03.750" end="01:04.170">thanking </span><span begin="01:04.170" end="01:04.800">God </span><span begin="01:04.800" end="01:04.860">you </span><span begin="01:04.860" end="01:05.490">found </span><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:06.180">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.660" end="01:08.130"><span begin="01:06.660" end="01:06.960">That </span><span begin="01:06.960" end="01:07.050">you </span><span begin="01:07.050" end="01:07.560">found </span><span begin="01:07.560" end="01:08.130">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.490" end="01:12.120"><span begin="01:08.490" end="01:08.730">So </span><span begin="01:08.730" end="01:09.030">don't </span><span begin="01:09.030" end="01:09.180">you </span><span begin="01:09.180" end="01:10.080">worry</span><span begin="01:10.080" end="01:10.590">, </span><span begin="01:10.590" end="01:11.040">about </span><span begin="01:11.040" end="01:12.120">tomorrow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.570" end="01:15.810"><span begin="01:12.570" end="01:13.020">Don't </span><span begin="01:13.020" end="01:13.140">you </span><span begin="01:13.140" end="01:14.160">worry</span><span begin="01:14.160" end="01:14.460">, </span><span begin="01:14.460" end="01:14.760">just </span><span begin="01:14.760" end="01:15.030">pass </span><span begin="01:15.030" end="01:15.090">the </span><span begin="01:15.090" end="01:15.810">bottle</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.230" end="01:22.080"><